      "message": "The current implementation supports specifying multiple filters per-tenant.\n\nIMO I think it would be enough to support a single filter per-tenant, what is your opinion on this ?\n\nRather than storing a list of filters in each `sfdp_tenant_t` instance, we could store a single vector mapping each tenant to its unique filter in `sfdp_main_t\n\ne.g.\n\n```\ntypedef struct {\n  ...\n\n  /* Vector of pre-filter per-tenant pool index. */\n  sfdp_pre_filter_registration_t **tenant_pre_filters;\n\n} sfdp_main_t;\n```",
      "revId": "2be4d068dfe6db938afa235982abc79360d37afb",
